# Model-generated text is DATA, not source. Some replies contain literal CRLF,
# and git's autocrlf was silently rewriting those to LF inside quoted CSV
# fields -- 89 cells across 6 files -- so a fresh clone did not reproduce the
# byte-level text comparisons the analysis depends on (e.g. the re-seed text
# divergence rate). Store these exactly as written.
*.csv    -text
*.joblib binary
*.gguf   binary
